{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼今日はね、ヘアアレンジした／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/2389338/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、右の髪をゆるく三つ編して左側に持ってきてカチューシャみたくして留めてみました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは、後ろの低い位置でお団子して完成なり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨の日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪をストレートにしても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"巻いてもとれてきちゃうから結ぶのですよ(σ*´∀｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクは髪で隠れてるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"分かりにくいですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイラインをネコっぽく上にはねあげました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/2389338/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服はmoussyとone-way"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ、本日のヘアメイクを紹介したところで若月ブログ始まりますよと(｀・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そういえばみさみさ!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近々炊飯器直しにいくからね(笑)炊飯器が可哀想だからね(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うそうそ(笑)みさみさの為にいきます。すみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、余談を挟んだところで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本題(素敵な体験)にむかいまっする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑痛いとか言わないで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのですね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し前なんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと東京に来たら一度は行きたいと思っていたメイド喫茶に川後と初めて行ってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ど緊張のあまり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイドさんにびくつく二人。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すると、優しくメイドさんが『今日はどちらからですか？』と声をかけてくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は思った。ここで、普通に返してはならないのではないかと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから私と川後は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月『あっ......スイーツの国からきました。恥』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後『わ、私はイチゴの星から...照』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイドさん『わぁー！そうなんですね!!私は月から来たんです!!』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つ、通じたああああああああ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵すぎる。しかも月からきただと(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月『あ!!月ですか。近いですね！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我ながら近いですねって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんなんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのメイドさんは、アポロに乗っていたのでしょうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月面の様子とか詳しく聞いとけばよかったかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という素敵な体験でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、メンバーのファッション紹介なり(*´ー｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":